Scenario: Delete contact and view
	Koroneiki contacts deleted via API should not be viewable via API.

	Given I create a contact on koroneiki with the following values
	| Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| First Name    | Koroneiki                                |
	| Language      | English                                  |
	| Last Name     | Contact1                                 |
	| Middle Name   | User                                     |
	| Okta ID       | koroneikicontact1                        |
	And I delete a contact on koroneiki with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken"
	Then I should not be able to view a koroneiki contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken"

